OL,3,GNEWSAFarm vet fears busy Bonfire Night
OL,4,Acalming cattle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vet who is set to spend Bonfire Night
OL,7,Ftreating cattle and sheep spooked by
OL,8,Ffireworks says there is "no doubt" they
OL,9,Fsuffer as much as family pets.
OL,11,FMolly McKay, who is based near Louth,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, said due to food
OL,13,Fregulations vets could not administer
OL,14,Fpreventative sedatives to farm animals,
OL,15,Fas is done for cats and dogs.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
