OL,3,GNEWSAFarm vet fears busy Bonfire Night
OL,4,Acalming cattle
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe veterinary surgeon said in previous
OL,7,Fyears she had treated cattle with
OL,8,Fbroken legs that had jumped fences,
OL,9,Fperformed caesarean sections on heifers
OL,10,Fin premature labour and rounded up an
OL,11,Fescaped herd that caused a traffic
OL,12,Fincident.
OL,14,FThe National Farmers Union (NFU) urged
OL,15,Fpeople planning displays to warn
OL,16,Ffarmers in the area so they could "take
OL,17,Fappropriate steps".
